{"id":"4B","title":"Law Publication","part":{"n":4,"title":"Law and Justice"},"url":"/law/04-law-and-justice/4b","entries":[{"id":"4B.1","text":"The law is to be revealed to the people; it is not to be kept secret, or made obscure, or hidden in any manner.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":29,"verses":"29"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":30,"verses":"11"}],"citation":"Deut. 29:29; Deut. 30:11."},{"id":"4B.2","text":"The law is to be publicly written, displayed and recorded.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":17,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":31,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":27,"verses":"1-3,8"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":31,"verses":"9,24-26"},{"book":"Joshua","chapter":8,"verses":"32"},{"book":"Joshua","chapter":24,"verses":"25-26"}],"citation":"Exod. 17:14; Exod. 31:18; Deut 27:1-3,8; Deut 31:9, 24-26; Josh. 8:32; Josh. 24:25-26."},{"id":"4B.3","text":"Every seven years, on the year of release, the law is to be read before all the people that they may learn and observe all the words of the law.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":31,"verses":"10-13"}],"citation":"Deut. 31:10-13."},{"id":"4B.4","text":"The Law is to be taught and instructed privately and publicly.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":5,"verses":"31"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":6,"verses":"7-8,20-25"},{"book":"Nehemiah","chapter":8,"verses":"1-9"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":36,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":13,"verses":"15"}],"citation":"Deut. 5:31; Deut. 6:7-8, 20-25; Neh. 8:1-9; Jer. 36:6; Acts 13:15."},{"id":"4B.5","text":"The law is to be displayed on door posts of homes and on city gates.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":6,"verses":"9"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":11,"verses":"20"}],"citation":"Deut. 6:9; Deut 11:20."},{"id":"4B.6","text":"The law is to be publicly read to remind the people of the law and that it is to be observed.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":24,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":35,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":5,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Joshua","chapter":8,"verses":"34-35"},{"book":"Nehemiah","chapter":8,"verses":"2-6,13-14"},{"book":"Nehemiah","chapter":13,"verses":"1-3"}],"citation":"Exod. 24:7; Exod. 35:1; Deut. 5:1; Josh. 8:34-35; Neh. 8:2-6, 13-14; Neh. 13:1-3."}]}